If you have downloaded this App, then you are the owner of this App, you can let it do the following things:

 1. Let it find the music you want to listen to and add it to your favorite playlist;
 2. Let it recommend your favorite music to you, so that you can discover more and better music;
 3. Let its built-in remote control function help you control your TV, and cast your favorite playlist to your TV;
 4. Let it automatically turn off the music playback when you fall asleep, so that you can maintain a quiet and deep sleep;
 5. More smarter and more humanized settings are under development, so you can look forward to it every day.

In a word, downloading it can fully meet your music listening needs and more user experience.

We would love to receive all your feedback to improve our app.

